I've been thinking that it would be interesting to have a very
powerful class added to the game which would effectively serve as an
"easy" option for the game for hopeless players like myself.  :)

Anyway, I wanted to pick everyone's collective brains for ideas on
what kind of role would be fitting for this.  I was thinking some
combination of fighting prowess and spellcasting ability would be
potent, but something like a "spellsword" or the like would be too
bland and uninspiring.  Something like a "dragon slayer" would be fun,
but how could one come up with a good quest that wouldn't be redundant
with the caveman's quest?

I'm not so much looking for ideas on what combinations of abilities
and intrinsics would be potent (though I don't mind hearing those) so
much as looking for some good heroic-seeming role to use as a
springboard for ideas when creating the class.

Ideas?


